id: pm-jira-atomic-replay-revisions
title: Bind atomic import replay identity to current target revisions
description: "Seeded older-input replays of an atomic-imported issue can reuse a key-only transaction identity with a different plan and fail the SDK journal-plan comparison. Preserve the SDK fail-closed guard; redesign recovery identity around current SDK target revisions and transaction ownership, skip foreign records, and report unchanged only after reading current state. The create-field preview is read-only and introduces no journals."
